# Doc 24: model weight files must never ship to the cloud deployment.
# The edge (ONNX) model loads only on local dev machines and the mobile
# app's on-device bundle — Render's backend must never contain these.
**/*.onnx
**/*.safetensors
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.bin
**/*.gguf
**/*.tflite
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
models/
checkpoints/